    C(KN, 'night_position', CO, 'entering the woods in the rear of the Third Brigade, took a position', 'Marched farther up the road and, entering the woods in the rear of the Third Brigade, took a position in line nearly at a right angle with the breastworks, sheltered by a ledge of rocks, connecting on the left with the Third Brigade', None, '07-02', place='woods in the rear of the Third Brigade'),
