    C(KN, 'engagement', CO, 'At 3 o\'clock next morning, July 3, the enemy\'s skirmishers commenced firing on us', 'At 3 a. m. July 3 the enemy\'s skirmishers commenced firing; by 4 a. m. the firing was general along the whole line on both sides', 'At 3 o\'clock next morning, July 3', '07-03', '03:00', place='whole line', grp='inf_start'),
    C(KN, 'engagement', CO, 'by 4 o\'clock the firing had become general along the whole line', 'By 4 a. m. the firing had become general along the whole line; the regiments relieved one another one at a time to replenish ammunition', 'by 4 o\'clock', '07-03', '04:00', place='whole line'),
